---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Acerca de - Frijolito AI">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-400 via-fuchsia-400 to-cyan-300 mb-4 tracking-tight">
        Acerca del Proyecto
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Descubre cómo conectamos un entorno frontend moderno con un microservicio seguro en Deno para consultar el SDK de Gemini AI.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Architecture Grid */}
    <div class="space-y-12">
      
      {/* Dynamic Diagram */}
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-violet-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500"></span> Flujo de la Arquitectura
        </h3>
        
        {/* Architecture visual grid */}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 items-center">
          
          <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold text-sm">1</div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1">Astro + React UI</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px] leading-snug">Interfaz de chat interactiva y ultrarrápida renderizada en el cliente.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hidden md:block text-center text-gray-500 font-bold">➔</div>

          <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold text-sm">2</div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1">Deno Backend</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px] leading-snug">Servidor HTTPS ligero que actúa como proxy seguro.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hidden md:block text-center text-gray-500 font-bold">➔</div>

          <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center md:col-span-1">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-500/20 text-fuchsia-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold text-sm">3</div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1">Gemini AI SDK</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px] leading-snug">El SDK oficial procesa el lenguaje natural y retorna respuestas.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Tech Stack Cards */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        {/* Astro Card */}
        <div class="bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Astro + Tailwind v4</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Estructuración de contenido veloz, soporte multi-framework para inyectar componentes interactivos con React y estilos ultra-optimizados con el nuevo compilador de Tailwind.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Deno Card */}
        <div class="bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Deno Runtime</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Entorno de ejecución de TypeScript seguro y moderno por defecto. Deno no requiere configuración pesada de npm ni bundlers para arrancar servidores HTTPS de alta velocidad.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Gemini Card */}
        <div class="bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-violet-500/10 text-violet-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Gemini SDK AI</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Consumo seguro del modelo `gemini-2.5-flash`. El SDK oficial en el servidor nos permite mantener la llave secreta alejada del navegador y previene fraudes o robos de cuota.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      {/* Security note */}
      <div class="bg-violet-950/20 border border-violet-500/20 rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-violet-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-300 shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1">Seguridad en Producción</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Toda la comunicación de red externa utiliza protocolos cifrados (HTTPS). Al canalizar el tráfico a través del servidor Deno, el navegador del usuario final nunca tiene acceso a tu clave `GEMINI_API_KEY`, cumpliendo con las mejores prácticas de seguridad web corporativa.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
